PayNow QR skill

This project is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or issued by the Monetary
Authority of Singapore, PayNow, NETS, or any Singapore bank.

PayNow transfers are typically irreversible. Confirm the encoded mobile or UEN,
amount, and reference before anyone scans a generated code. The receiving bank
shows the registered account name on scan — that is the real typo check.

Do not commit assets/defaults.json. That file can contain a personal mobile
number after setup.

